Kora data licence

The footballer data in this folder (pool.json and the files beside it) and
the hints that will be written from it are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Share-alike applies because part of the data comes from Wikipedia (decision
P29, 4 October 2026).

Photos are not covered by this licence. Each photo, cropped or not, stays
under its own Wikimedia Commons file's licence and is credited per file
(author, licence, licence link and file page are stored with it): a crop
cannot be relicensed.

Sources, with their own licences:

- English and French Wikipedia: article text and infobox facts, CC BY-SA 4.0.
  pool.json records the article each value came from.
- Wikimedia Commons: photos, each under its own file's licence.
- Wikidata: CC0 1.0.
- martj42/international_results (international results and goalscorers):
  CC0 1.0.

The code of this repository keeps its own licence (MIT, see the LICENSE file
at the root).
